{"id":"503d015c67c34259","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-hopf-invariants.md","title":"Hopf Invariants","display":"df-hopf-invariants — Hopf Invariants","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-hopf-invariants","aliases":["58-df-hopf-invariants"],"display":"df-hopf-invariants — Hopf Invariants","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-mapping-cone.md]]","[[58-df-continuous-function.md]]","[[58-df-oriented-cone-generators.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-hopf-invariants"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-hopf-invariants</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-hopf-invariants — Hopf Invariants"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4397ca2cdf99ab61\" href=\"?note=4397ca2cdf99ab61\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-mapping-cone.md\">../batch11/58-df-mapping-cone.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b2e63b755a37f1dc\" href=\"?note=b2e63b755a37f1dc\" title=\"58-df-continuous-function.md\">58-df-continuous-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6da8e7b12b3b6d38\" href=\"?note=6da8e7b12b3b6d38\" title=\"58-df-oriented-cone-generators.md\">58-df-oriented-cone-generators.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,n,h,C_f,x,y,\\tau_C\\in V\">\\(f,n,h,C_f,x,y,\\tau_C\\in V\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^k,\\tau_k\">\\(S^k,\\tau_k\\)</span>、整数系数空间码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma(A,\\tau)\">\\(\\sigma(A,\\tau)\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6da8e7b12b3b6d38\" href=\"?note=6da8e7b12b3b6d38\" title=\"58-df-oriented-cone-generators.md\">58-df-oriented-cone-generators.md</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MappingCone}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{MappingCone}_S\\)</span> 保留四元接口，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CanonicalConeGenerators}_S(x,y,C_f,n)\">\\(\\operatorname{CanonicalConeGenerators}_S(x,y,C_f,n)\\)</span> 由该依赖中的带符号链与配对定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_C=\\sigma(C_f,\\tau_C)\">\\(\\sigma_C=\\sigma(C_f,\\tau_C)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\smile_{\\sigma_C,n,n}\">\\(\\smile_{\\sigma_C,n,n}\\)</span> 是 <code>58-df-singular-coefficient-data</code> 实际构造的上同调杯积，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\\,y\">\\(h\\,y\\)</span> 为商群的整数倍。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HopfInvariant}_S(f,n,h)\">\\(\\operatorname{HopfInvariant}_S(f,n,h)\\)</span> 保留三元接口。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hopf\\text{-}invariants}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{HopfInvariant}_S(f,n,h)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nn\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0,1\\}\\land h\\in\\mathbb Z\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{ContinuousFunction}_S(f,S^{2n-1},\\tau_{2n-1},S^n,\\tau_n)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists C_f,\\tau_C,x,y\\;[\\operatorname{MappingCone}_S(C_f,f,S^{2n-1},S^n)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\operatorname{ConeTopology}_{58,S}(\\tau_C,C_f,f,S^{2n-1},\\tau_{2n-1},S^n,\\tau_n)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\operatorname{CanonicalConeGenerators}_S(x,y,C_f,n)\n\\land x\\smile_{\\sigma_C,n,n}x=h\\,y].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hopf\\text{-}invariants}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{HopfInvariant}_S(f,n,h)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nn\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0,1\\}\\land h\\in\\mathbb Z\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{ContinuousFunction}_S(f,S^{2n-1},\\tau_{2n-1},S^n,\\tau_n)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists C_f,\\tau_C,x,y\\;[\\operatorname{MappingCone}_S(C_f,f,S^{2n-1},S^n)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\operatorname{ConeTopology}_{58,S}(\\tau_C,C_f,f,S^{2n-1},\\tau_{2n-1},S^n,\\tau_n)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\operatorname{CanonicalConeGenerators}_S(x,y,C_f,n)\n\\land x\\smile_{\\sigma_C,n,n}x=h\\,y].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>保留 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge2\">\\(n\\ge2\\)</span> 的有向 Hopf 不变量及原三元公开关系；正负号由内部定义固定。</li>\n<li>生成元、锥的商拓扑和杯积不再作为“显式原语”声明。它们都由实际函数图、有限链与商类给出。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-mapping-cone.md","status":"resolved","id":"4397ca2cdf99ab61","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-mapping-cone.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-continuous-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"b2e63b755a37f1dc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-continuous-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-oriented-cone-generators.md","status":"resolved","id":"6da8e7b12b3b6d38","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-oriented-cone-generators.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-oriented-cone-generators.md","status":"resolved","id":"6da8e7b12b3b6d38","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f,n,h,C_f,x,y,\\tau_C\\in V$；$S^k,\\tau_k$、整数系数空间码 $\\sigma(A,\\tau)$ 使用 [[58-df-oriented-cone-generators.md]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"f,n,h,C_f,x,y,\\tau_C\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"S^k,\\tau_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma(A,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MappingCone}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CanonicalConeGenerators}_S(x,y,C_f,n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma_C=\\sigma(C_f,\\tau_C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\smile_{\\sigma_C,n,n}","display":false},{"tex":"h\\,y","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{HopfInvariant}_S(f,n,h)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hopf\\text{-}invariants}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{HopfInvariant}_S(f,n,h)\\leftrightarrow{}&\nn\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0,1\\}\\land h\\in\\mathbb Z\\\\\n&\\land\\operatorname{ContinuousFunction}_S(f,S^{2n-1},\\tau_{2n-1},S^n,\\tau_n)\\\\\n&\\land\\exists C_f,\\tau_C,x,y\\;[\\operatorname{MappingCone}_S(C_f,f,S^{2n-1},S^n)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\operatorname{ConeTopology}_{58,S}(\\tau_C,C_f,f,S^{2n-1},\\tau_{2n-1},S^n,\\tau_n)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\operatorname{CanonicalConeGenerators}_S(x,y,C_f,n)\n\\land x\\smile_{\\sigma_C,n,n}x=h\\,y].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"n\\ge2","display":false}],"bytes":1703,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-648","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-hopf-invariants.md|58-df-hopf-invariants]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["4397ca2cdf99ab61","b2e63b755a37f1dc","6da8e7b12b3b6d38"]}